# EclipseOS Plasma light colour scheme.
# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
#
# The light counterpart to EclipseOS.colors. Backgrounds use the brand's
# surfaceLight values, text uses textPrimaryLight/textSecondaryLight, and the
# violet accent is shared with the dark scheme.

